  "content_rendered": "\n<p></p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns vk-cols--media vk_block-margin-0--margin-bottom is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-1 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-style-rounded\"><a href=\"https://mokaruguam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Mokaru-Logo-1.png\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://mokaruguam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Mokaru-Logo-1.png\" alt=\"Mokaru icon\" class=\"wp-image-2444\" srcset=\"https://mokaruguam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Mokaru-Logo-1.png 500w, https://mokaruguam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Mokaru-Logo-1-300x300.png 300w, https://mokaruguam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Mokaru-Logo-1-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" /></a><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Mokaru Guam Icon</figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading is-style-vk-heading-plain vk_block-margin-0--margin-bottom has-huge-font-size\" style=\"line-height:1.4\">このたびはMokaru Guamのツアーをご予約いただき、誠にありがとうございます！</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer vk_spacer-type-height\"><div class=\"vk_block-margin-sm--height\"></div></div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"vk_block-margin-sm--margin-bottom\">ご登録のメールアドレスに<strong>予約内容の確認メール</strong>をお送りしておりますので、そちらもあわせてご確認ください。<br>※迷惑メールフォルダに振り分けられる場合がございますので、ご注意ください。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"vk_block-margin-sm--margin-bottom\">🗓️ ツアー当日までの流れ</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🧳 ツアー当日までの流れ</h3>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>前日までにLINEまたはメールにて<strong>最終確認のご連絡</strong>を差し上げます</li>\n\n\n\n<li>ご不明点やリクエストがあれば、お気軽にLINEまたはメールでご相談ください</li>\n\n\n\n<li>当日は、ホテルロビーでお待ちしております！</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">📱 お問い合わせ・ご連絡先</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>ご不明点がありましたら、いつでもお気軽にご連絡ください。</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>📩 メール：<a>tour@mokaruguam.com</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li>📱 LINE：<a href=\"https://lin.ee/YQJxwRp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://lin.ee/YQJxwRp</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"vk_block-margin-sm--margin-bottom\">Mokaruならではの特別なグアム体験を、心をこめてご案内させていただきます。<br>当日お会いできるのを楽しみにしております😊</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-social-links is-style-logos-only is-layout-flex wp-container-core-social-links-is-layout-1 wp-block-social-links-is-layout-flex\"><li class=\"wp-social-link wp-social-link-wordpress  wp-block-social-link\"><a href=\"https://わーどぷれす\" class=\"wp-block-social-link-anchor\" target=\"_blank\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M12.158,12.786L9.46,20.625c0.806,0.237,1.657,0.366,2.54,0.366c1.047,0,2.051-0.181,2.986-0.51 c-0.024-0.038-0.046-0.079-0.065-0.124L12.158,12.786z M3.009,12c0,3.559,2.068,6.634,5.067,8.092L3.788,8.341 C3.289,9.459,3.009,10.696,3.009,12z M18.069,11.546c0-1.112-0.399-1.881-0.741-2.48c-0.456-0.741-0.883-1.368-0.883-2.109 c0-0.826,0.627-1.596,1.51-1.596c0.04,0,0.078,0.005,0.116,0.007C16.472,3.904,14.34,3.009,12,3.009 c-3.141,0-5.904,1.612-7.512,4.052c0.211,0.007,0.41,0.011,0.579,0.011c0.94,0,2.396-0.114,2.396-0.114 C7.947,6.93,8.004,7.642,7.52,7.699c0,0-0.487,0.057-1.029,0.085l3.274,9.739l1.968-5.901l-1.401-3.838 C9.848,7.756,9.389,7.699,9.389,7.699C8.904,7.67,8.961,6.93,9.446,6.958c0,0,1.484,0.114,2.368,0.114 c0.94,0,2.397-0.114,2.397-0.114c0.485-0.028,0.542,0.684,0.057,0.741c0,0-0.488,0.057-1.029,0.085l3.249,9.665l0.897-2.996 C17.841,13.284,18.069,12.316,18.069,11.546z M19.889,7.686c0.039,0.286,0.06,0.593,0.06,0.924c0,0.912-0.17